# Coding conventions

Stack is **not finalized** — follow whatever `docs/04_engineering/ENGINEERING_ARCHITECTURE.md` states once updated after `OPEN_ITEMS.md` is resolved.

## General

- Prefer **TypeScript** with explicit types for public APIs and shared models.
- **Colocate** feature code under `src/features/<feature>/`; shared UI in `src/components/`.
- Match types to `docs/04_engineering/CONTENT_SCHEMA.md` and `docs/02_product/DATA_CONTENT_MODEL_SPEC.md`.

## Product rules in code

- **Guest-first** — no forced auth on initial routes.
- **English-first slugs** — routing and canonical IDs; locale for display only unless IA specifies otherwise.
- **Sources** — UI must support source records on sensitive content; do not strip provenance.

## Quality

- Add tests for non-trivial logic (checklist rules, next-action ordering) when implemented.
- No secrets in source; use environment variables documented in deployment docs.
